WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.000
Sousei Gattai. Worship!

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Sousei Gattai. Save!

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.840
Aquarion!

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.670
I can hear his voice!

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.510
Who are you?

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:15.880
I don't know! I don't know, but... I love it!

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.380
I love this voice!

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:20.710
Subete!

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.880
"Buildings"

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.880
"Trees"

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:27.620
"Buildings" "Benches" "Trees"

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.860
I'll be taking Maia back, Subete Kenzaki!

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:34.700
It's time to settle this, Akira Kaibuki!

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:41.240
Modern people only understand things by connecting words and phenomena.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:44.910
So, when writing vanishes with the Logos World,

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:50.710
people won't understand any concepts, and modern civilization will end.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:59.490
<i>The world is engulfed by an unvoiced scream</i>

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:05.430
<i>and I wait for it to reach and stir</i> <i>a certain someone's heart</i>

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:11.230
<i>With strength flowing to the edges of our souls</i>

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>we set out into the white</i> <i>morning haze, without hesitation</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:20.440
<i>I want to know everything about you</i>

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:30.440
<i>But just when I thought</i>
<i>I had you, you were gone</i>

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:39.530
<i>It's love, affection, passion, expression</i>

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:46.140
<i>These tightly-sealed, silent lips</i>

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:50.510
<i>gently reply back in kind</i>

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:54.780
<i>And with love, affection, passion, expression</i>

00:01:54.780 --> 00:02:01.280
<i>Now, from the last of the words I couldn't find,</i>

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:09.990
<i>the music begins</i>

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:24.700
"Gather! Voices for Tomorrow"

00:02:25.470 --> 00:02:27.810
Give Maia back to me, Subete Kenzaki!

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:29.640
I won't let you have her!

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:46.330
Seven years ago, Sougon Kenzaki took my body out of the Logos World

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:49.060
and created you, a puppet.

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:54.200
At the same time, that act destabilized the balance of the Logos World.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:55.340
The balance...?

00:02:55.340 --> 00:03:00.580
The Logos World is a fusion of myself and the Aquarion Logos of long ago.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:04.410
If you remove me from the equation, even if it's only my body,

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.850
naturally, the balance will be broken.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:10.190
As a result, things gradually started to go wrong in the Logos World,

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:12.860
and written words began to be distorted.

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:15.360
Making use of those distorted words,

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:19.360
Sougon Kenzaki began to make M.J.B.K.s.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:20.360
Then...

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:24.300
I told you, didn't I? Everything is your fault.

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:39.040
Even so, he promised to save me.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.820
I don't like it.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.560
You look pained.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:52.590
Shall I help?

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:57.900
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:01.470
Kiryu's powers that you inherited...

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.740
I'll be borrowing them for a bit.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:05.240
Verbalize.

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:08.270
Subete!

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:11.410
Sou!

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:20.990
You're a threat to the world! I...

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:22.760
...will kill you!

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:25.850
Akira, I won't let you become a savior!

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.630
Subete!

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:32.530
Watch as the world ends!
That will be your defeat!

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.110
Maia...

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.010
Is that where you are?

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:41.680
I will save it!

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:44.940
--What?!
--The world where Maia can live!

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:47.950
I won't let you go!

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:54.190
N-No...

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.290
Damn...

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.850
Damn it all!

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:01.730
Don't go...

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:14.970
He vanished.

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:23.680
The one I treasure, the one who gave meaning to my life...

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.390
Maia.

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:28.160
Too bad.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:33.860
Without the Book of Verbalism, neither of you can register his existence.

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:35.660
Lick each other's wounds.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:39.900
As a man and woman who've both lost what mattered most to them.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:42.400
I knew this would happen.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:46.240
But still, even if it meant hurting you,

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:48.610
there were things I had to do.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.550
You don't have to forgive me.

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:56.420
Just let me tell you one last thing.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:06:00.260
Maia, I...

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:03.420
I love you!!

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:10.100
The Logos World is the embodiment of my and Aquarion Logos's hatred.

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:15.440
To cause an annihilation reaction, you need its total opposite.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:19.710
The opposite of hatred. In other words, love!

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:24.150
You will end this world!
The Aquarion Logos of love!

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:33.060
It'll be fine.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:34.790
Who's there?

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:38.090
It must have hurt. You must have been lonely.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.800
But it will all be okay now.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:44.390
I am you.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:51.970
A world without writing.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:57.310
People who only understood things through writing will lose that crutch,

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:02.250
and they will no longer be able to recognize themselves and others.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:06.960
What awaits after that is the unification of all consciousness.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:11.430
An altruistic world where every person understands everyone else!

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:14.760
Where love is all! How marvelous!

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.830
Just kidding!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:21.470
Unlike the people prior to the invention of writing,

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:27.780
people nowadays can't establish their personalities without writing.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:30.810
While absorbed in the pleasure of being connected,

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:33.950
their spirits will gently die away.

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:36.940
Too bad for you, humanity.

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:44.620
Huh?

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:48.000
Why?

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.000
Are you a person who should be here?

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.000
Huh?

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:56.970
All you did was one-sidedly force your love on another.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:08:00.470
Was that all there was to your most cherished wish?

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:03.210
You can be so harsh.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:07.650
Subete did his best. You saw that for yourself.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:10.690
Now that you've lost everything,

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:15.820
there must still have been a feeling you could not let go of.

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:18.490
Dad... I...

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:42.850
It's empty.

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:46.190
I want you to know, too. How it is we feel.

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:48.860
Let's be connected.

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:50.690
Stay away!

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:53.600
You're hurting after losing something important, right?

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:54.860
But it'll all be okay.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:57.530
Stop! Don't come inside me!

00:08:57.530 --> 00:09:01.900
I am Maia Tsukigane! I won't become one with you people!

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:08.780
This is...

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:10.800
Here, over this way.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:26.230
"Akira Kaibuki"

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:29.570
It won't help. You can no longer recognize that as writing,

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:32.560
let alone read it.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:35.240
"Akira Kaibuki"

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:36.270
It's useless.

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:38.260
You couldn't possibly understand it.

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:41.740
I know this...

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:45.110
Because I couldn't understand, either.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:48.420
I don't understand... but I know this...

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:51.850
This is my... my...!

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.250
Why can you...?!

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:14.440
"Akira Kaibuki"

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:16.450
I know!

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:19.620
I don't want to forget! I don't want to lose it!

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:22.350
That is why I'm here!

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:25.450
To give voice to this feeling!

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:27.010
Accept it!

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:30.190
Akira!

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:40.390
Maia!

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:55.850
You came...

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:59.550
I'll go anywhere for you. For I am...

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:02.080
...your savior.

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:08.500
Subete!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.230
Why won't you vanish, Akira Kaibuki?

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:13.500
Maia called me back!

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:16.240
As long as someone feels for me and has a voice to call out to me,

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:18.070
I will never vanish!

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:20.340
That is what it means to be human!

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:23.680
You wretched little puppet!

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:26.050
Are you jealous of her?

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:29.210
Don't talk like you'd know!

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:35.420
I●●●

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.860
--Subete, you must...
--Subete, you must...

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.860
...protect the one you love.

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:42.230
...strike down your fated enemy.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.700
Why can't you say the same thing as me?

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:46.700
Right back at you.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:49.770
A boy has to protect the girl he likes!

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:55.280
A man has things he must put before love!

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.210
They're squabbling...

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:00.720
But thank you.

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:05.890
You thought I'd let you run off with the victory?

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:07.720
I'm not exactly running.

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:11.230
I can't have you vanish on me while acting smug like that!

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:14.230
If you're going to vanish, do it <i>after</i> I beat you!

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:16.300
Hey, you two...

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:18.230
What is the matter with you people?!

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:19.720
Sou!

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.940
Don't touch Maia!

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:29.750
Subete! Do you even realize what you're doing?!

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:31.250
I do!

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:33.920
You'll probably say I'm acting inconsistent and crazy!

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:36.790
But what choice do I have?
That's just who I am!

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:38.910
That's perfect. Help me out here.

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:46.600
You two...

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:50.270
We're going, Ultimate Verbalism.

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:55.000
Aquarion!

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:03.150
Damn... he's forcing himself on me...

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:05.850
Don't let that bug you. Because... this feels...

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:08.320
...like you're being sent to heaven...

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:10.620
It's so good!

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:18.290
Logos Genesis!

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:20.660
What is this power?!

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:32.370
Mugen Blade!

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.410
"Mugen Blade"

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.570
Why, you...!

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:59.430
"Buildings"

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:59.430
"Trees"

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:59.430
"Ground"

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:06.340
Huh? What were we doing again?

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:09.680
It's like we were in a long dream.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.540
What?

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:18.420
Why are Aquarion and an M.J.B.K. in this world?

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:19.720
What are those?!

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:21.420
A... A monster?!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:22.860
It's a robot!

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:24.620
Is this being projected?

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:28.060
Now you've gone and done it.

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.430
Fill with hatred!

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.030
Verbalize.

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:37.870
I won't lose to you... you people...!

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:40.410
That's a good voice.

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:42.040
We can't throw it off.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:45.080
Nesta has greater Verbalism Ability than we do.

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:48.120
She's better than the three of us.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:50.710
Better than "the three of us," yes.

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:55.550
Don't lose!

00:14:57.460 --> 00:15:00.400
Kaibuki, Tsukigane, hang in there!

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:02.230
You aren't going to let it end here, are you?

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:04.130
We're with you!

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:06.570
Our voices are reaching you, right?

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:08.330
We'll support you, too!

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.110
Yes! They are reaching us!

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:17.410
The countless voices of support!

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:29.520
Let's get to the punchline.

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:34.160
Go for it!

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.930
You'd better not lose!

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:37.100
Take it out!

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:38.830
Keep fighting, savior!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.470
Akira, we're counting on you.

00:15:40.470 --> 00:15:42.140
We're cheering for you, too!

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:44.270
Show them that Verbalism Club spirit!

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:45.670
Give the children a future!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.440
You are our representatives!

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:48.480
The world is in your hands.

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:50.180
I'm praying for you, too!

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:52.650
You can do it! It'll all work out! Believe!

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:55.280
Do Tsutomu's share, as well.

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:57.320
Be strong, Akira.

00:15:57.320 --> 00:16:00.620
Go, Akira! Now is the moment of salvation!

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:04.290
Yeah.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:07.460
Voices can lend such strength.

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:10.470
Go and become a man, Subete.

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:12.330
Mr. Hayashi...

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:15.000
You can do it. For you are...

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:18.670
You are our son.

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:21.710
I know, Mom, Dad.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:25.480
Go for it!

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:29.880
The voices of foolish humans are creating hope...

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:32.220
That can't be...

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.860
Going beyond the infinite...

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:35.490
...shredding even the stars...

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:37.320
...sword of the heavens...

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:40.260
"Universe Blade"

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:42.490
I will not accept it!

00:16:44.430 --> 00:16:45.870
"Universe Blade"

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:52.000
Universe Blade!

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:15.920
Sube... te?!

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:23.900
Kiryu...

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:30.370
Did you read my letter?

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:33.210
But it said...!

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:44.560
This is probably the last time my words will reach you.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:46.960
I am to be executed tomorrow.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:51.300
Still, I do not regret our days of love in the least.

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:53.900
I'm glad to have been able to meet you.

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:56.600
I'm sure I will scream your name until the end,

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:59.770
recalling your face as I fade away.

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:02.810
I think that's something
I should be happy about.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:08.010
Because I can die so full of love.

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:14.290
I see...

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:19.090
All along, that letter was full of such pure feelings...

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:22.300
Why couldn't I believe in him?

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:24.860
I love you, Nesta.

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:28.590
Kiryu!

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:47.460
They won, right?

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:49.960
Seems like it.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.620
"Tree" "Building"

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:53.130
"Cloud" "Tree"

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:53.130
"Buildings"

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:53.130
Then what is this? There are kanji pasted everywhere.

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:57.670
This is likely due to the
Logos World having vanished.

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:59.500
"Buildings"

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:59.500
"Person"

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:57.130
"Clothes"

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:59.500
"Bag"

00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:59.470
The Logos World did this?

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:02.700
Is that how Aquarion is in this world?

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:03.510
"Cloud" "Sky"

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:03.510
"Buildings"

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:03.510
"Road"

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:03.710
Yes.

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:10.910
"Building" "Tree"

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:10.910
"Stone"

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:07.810
And the written words that lost their place with the Logos World disappearing

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:10.880
are maintaining their existence by pasting themselves on their phenomena.

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:12.650
This is dangerous.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:20.090
"Sky"

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:20.090
"Buildings"

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:20.090
"Cloud"

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:16.220
I see. If written words have taken concrete form,

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:20.050
it's possible we'll give them power by speaking them aloud.

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:24.660
You mean in the same way that everyone has some Verbalism Ability?

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:26.430
"City"

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.730
Yes, that would be right.

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:29.530
Pay me back the money I loaned you already.

00:19:29.530 --> 00:19:32.570
You... You can just go die!

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:35.200
"Building"

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:34.070
Huh?

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.200
"Death"

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:42.680
With the Logos World gone,

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:46.240
anyone can access the world of truth.

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:49.620
I wish it would all just break to pieces.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:50.450
"Break"

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:53.450
"Cloud" "Sky"

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:53.450
"Buildings"

00:19:53.450 --> 00:20:01.860
"Clouds"

00:19:53.450 --> 00:20:01.860
"Sky"

00:19:53.450 --> 00:20:01.860
"Building"

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:59.690
But we've all gotten too used to the culture of writing.

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:04.030
We don't know how to access the world of truth properly.

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:07.240
"Sky"

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:07.240
"Clouds" "Tree"

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:07.240
"Ground"

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:05.770
Then...

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:09.040
The threat to the world hasn't passed yet.

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:11.630
"Sky" "Cloud"

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:11.630
"Trees"

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:24.250
"Cloud"

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:18.080
This world needs the Logos World.

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:24.450
So Aquarion Logos and I will become a new Logos World.

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:33.390
"Sky" "Cloud"

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:33.390
"Tree"

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:30.090
The Logos World was formed from
Aquarion Logos and Nesta's hatred.

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:33.760
Then, with this Aquarion and human will,

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:37.070
I should be able to create a Logos World.

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:38.560
Maia...

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:42.640
Akira, I'm grateful to you.

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:48.240
That I, a mere puppet, haven't vanished now that Nesta is gone

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:58.420
"Sky"

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:51.510
"Tree"

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:50.110
must be thanks to you.

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:56.750
My feelings for you made me human.

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:58.420
"Tree"

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:00.410
"Tree" "Sky"

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:06.260
Once I become the Logos World, the human me will likely vanish.

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:09.430
But that's fine. I'm satisfied.

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:11.020
Are you an idiot?

00:21:12.030 --> 00:21:24.710
"Sky"

00:21:12.030 --> 00:21:18.310
"Tree"

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:13.600
You must be an idiot.

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:15.340
Don't say it twice!

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.810
Who are you calling an idiot?!
I'm trying to show my determination here!

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:24.710
"Trees"

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:22.440
I decided to save you <i>and</i> this world.

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:24.680
I'd never let you sacrifice yourself.

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:26.610
But then...

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:30.310
I'll go. I'll become the Logos World.

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:35.160
Hold it. Who said you could decide that?

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:36.120
Subete...

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:39.330
Akira, I won't let you save the world!

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:41.630
So I'm going to be the Logos World!

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:42.630
Huh?

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:47.740
"Sky"

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:45.130
I'll save the world for you.

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:47.800
There couldn't possibly be a better defeat to hand you.

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:49.540
Quiet, you sheltered rich kid.

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:50.870
Stay out of my way, dweeb.

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:52.210
--Loser.
--Self-centered prick.

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:53.470
--Cowardly weakling.
--You're dense as a brick.

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:54.480
You can't keep a consistent character.

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:56.810
Hey! You don't have to fight over me!

00:21:56.810 --> 00:21:58.510
--This isn't about you!
--This isn't about you!

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:04.750
"Ground"

00:22:03.020 --> 00:22:04.190
"Wind"

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:09.660
"Cloud" "Sky"

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:08.320
Shall we?

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:09.660
Let's.

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:11.490
Huh? Hey, wait!

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:25.770
<i>I want to lend you a true voice</i>

00:22:35.850 --> 00:22:41.190
<i>With the warmth of salvation,</i>
<i>I raise my hand into the sky</i>

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:45.930
<i>and everything in the world gains its true colors</i>

00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:48.600
<i>(Focus) A sound that was once hidden</i>

00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:51.700
<i>(on the goal) will connect us now</i>

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:54.200
<i>Try to understand that, okay?</i>

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:56.640
<i>So, are you ready?</i>

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:59.440
<i>(heart and soul) These silent teardrops</i>

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:02.040
<i>(narrow escape) that flow forth now</i>

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:05.550
<i>(enamored) are proof of that person's existence</i>

00:23:05.550 --> 00:23:12.050
<i>You can't go inside your heart all alone</i>

00:23:12.050 --> 00:23:14.620
<i>I will hesitate no more</i>

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:19.790
<i>I want to lend you a true voice</i>

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:25.000
<i>A useful life, a sparkling utopia</i>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:34.110
<i>When your heart and voice</i> <i>tremble together, you'll surpass all</i>

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:37.510
<i>So go for your heart</i>

00:23:50.430 --> 00:23:53.090
Isn't it, like, impossible to win the final battle without me?

00:23:53.090 --> 00:23:54.160
Can you protect the world?

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.500
We'll be fine!

00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:56.760
Yeah! Stupid Tsutomu!

00:23:56.760 --> 00:23:57.930
We believe!

00:23:57.930 --> 00:23:59.470
They're all working together!

00:23:59.470 --> 00:24:03.440
I can fight because I'm not alone! For I am...

00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:04.440
What is it?

00:24:04.440 --> 00:24:05.940
Find out next week.

00:24:05.940 --> 00:24:06.940
Next time, the final episode:

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:09.780
"It Will Not End! Aquarion Logos."

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:09.780
"Episode 26: It Will Not End! Aquarion Logos"
